>BTW: Is there any way to get Stormbringer and stay lawful? Is it wise
>to put a helm of change alingment on and pray to that chaotic god?
>Does my lwaful god get pissed off?

In order to do what you want, you have to change your alignment to
chaotic, get a chaotic altar to give Stormy, then change back to lawful.
One way to change your alignment to the altar's is to kill and sacrafice
your dog.  Then pray.  Get your stormy and then use the helmet of
alignment change.  If you have another tame pet, you can use it to get
back from chaotic to lawful.  That is if you find a lawful altar.

